        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='15590' hidden='true' id='16' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='25723' x='68614' y='67385'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Story of Strategic Elimination:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>1. The mid-range got pushed out</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>2. Guards and wings didn&apos;t abandon the rim, they abandoned the elbow</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>3. Wings became the most three-point reliant position in the league</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>4. The rim held flat. The middle disappeared.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>5. Teams didn&apos;t shoot more. They shot smarter</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='11590' hidden='true' id='17' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='8916' x='3795' y='23179'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Era 1:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>1. No strategy</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>2. Pure experimentation </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>3. Deliberate weapon</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>4. Slow adopters </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>5. Fully independent </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>6. No effect </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='11692' hidden='true' id='18' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='8976' x='18193' y='23077'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Era 2:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>1. Grind adopters </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>2. Strongest negative </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>3. Pace suppressed </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>4. Efficiency tool</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>5. Controlled breaks </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>6. Disciplined speed </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='11692' hidden='true' id='19' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='9217' x='61988' y='23179'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Era 3:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>1. Correlation flips </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>2. Pace aligns </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>3. Rules opened </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>4. Analytics emerging </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>5. Still disciplined </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>6. Turnovers controlled </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='11590' hidden='true' id='20' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='9217' x='77771' y='22974'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Era 4:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>1. Strongest correlation </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>2. Speed confirms </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>3. Blueprint copied </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>4. Turnovers dropped </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>5. Speed efficiency </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>6. Champions separated </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='17744' hidden='true' id='21' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='13636' x='35515' y='22462'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>3-Point Scoring Share:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>1. Share multiplied</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>2. Era contrast</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>3. Sharpest jump</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>4. Analytics committed</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>5. Mid-range distruption</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='17744' hidden='true' id='23' story-point-id='6' type-v2='text' w='33735' x='29819' y='47179'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>It Don&apos;t Mean a Thing Without the Ring!</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>1. Three of four champions ranked outside the Top 5 in 3-point attempts and won anyway</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>2. The Bulls went 72-10 while barely cracking the top half of the league in 3PA</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>3. The 2005 Spurs are the loudest counter-argument. 13th in 3PA, won the championships</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>4. 2015 was the first time a champion and a top three-point shooting team were the same team</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>5. For three decades volume didn&apos;t predict winning. Golden State made it inseparable.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='14256' hidden='true' id='24' story-point-id='5' type-v2='text' w='22530' x='36205' y='21333'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>  Bigs Redefined</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>1. Outliers became the standard</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>2. The trendline couldn&apos;t predict the break</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>3. Past bigs were criticized for what modern bigs get paid for</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{D3CEA805-CD80-4E88-BEC0-FC4E2F78064F}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Objective'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='860' maxwidth='1550' minheight='560' minwidth='420' sizing-mode='range' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='77830' id='3' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='C:/Users/smsut/OneDrive/Documents/Data Analytics Bootcamp/Nba stats/Capstone files/nba-logo.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='24194' x='1484' y='16919' />
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11319' id='4' type-v2='text' w='97677' x='1613' y='1050'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='30' italic='true'>NBA THREE-POINT REVOLUTION</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='30' italic='true'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='4' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#c9082a' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='60093' id='7' type-v2='text' w='59032' x='32194' y='23104'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#17408b' fontsize='28'>OBJECTIVE:</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#17408b' fontsize='15'>The 3 point shot has changed the way the NBA game is played in the modern era. The goal of this project is to illustrate how those changes took place and give a view on how the NBA has evolved.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#17408b' fontsize='18'>The Overarching Questions:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#17408b' fontsize='15'>1. How large is the shift in scoring and pace?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#17408b' fontsize='15'>2. Which shots were abandoned and which exploded?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#17408b' fontsize='15'>3. Who drove the evolution and how did positional roles change?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#17408b' fontsize='15'>4. Did shooting more threes actually produce championships?</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
