                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#17408b' fontsize='15'>The 3 point shot has changed the way the NBA game is played in the modern era. The goal of this project is to illustrate how those changes took place and give a view on how the NBA has evolved.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#17408b' fontsize='18'>The Overarching Questions:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
